Bain karti thi yeh rokar madar haye Sughra<br>
Ae meri mehlaqa meri dilbar haye Sughra<br>
<br>
Kya dagha degi mujhko pyari maa ye wari,<br>
Chal basi kookh meri jala kar haye Sughra.<br>
<br>
Das baras ki kamayi meri aah lut gayi aah,<br>
Phir gaya mujhse mera muqaddar haye Sughra.<br>
<br>
Sabr kyukar karegi yeh madar bolo beta,<br>
Dil ko kyukar manaungi mai phir haye Sughra.<br>
<br>
Meri nashaad meri pyari meri nadaa'n,<br>
Meri ghumqaro nachar duqtar haye Sughra.